   "content": {
    "title": "Songs for all time: Dolly Parton's six greatest hits",
    "lead": "Poverty, pain, and love: The country icon with the blonde wigs and clear soprano voice has fallen silent. Millions recognize themselves in her songs and her story. What do they tell?",
    "author": ""
   },
